#
# The Mali gate's pins. tools/check.sh reads this file at the Mali test row
# (it is shell, sourced). It lives under tools/mali so that a Mali change
# which moves a pin selects the mali scope only; in check.sh it would select
# every row (scope_of_path maps tools/check.sh to `all`).
#
# MALI_TESTS: the number of tests `cargo test --lib mali::
# the_triangle_sample_shaders_build_on_the_mali` passes with none failed or
# ignored, in the host-test,gpu-mali,shaderc-online,no-shader-table build.
# Measure it by running tools/mali/check.sh (the row prints the count it
# found when it differs), or the filter by hand: the "test result: ok. N
# passed" line. A test added or removed moves it in the same commit.
MALI_TESTS=340
